":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1780751249591217404.wav","language":"中文","cv":"刘颐诺","category":"combat"},{"id":"1514097978770092032-voice-13-0-1512925927027904512","title":"重伤3","text":"有些……狼狈了呢……","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1780751249765491603.wav","language":"中文","cv":"刘颐诺","category":"combat"},{"id":"1514097978770092032-voice-13-0-1512925915303198720","title":"力竭1","text":"回忆……消散了……","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1780751246988804484.wav","language":"中文","cv":"刘颐诺","category":"combat"},{"id":"1514097978770092032-voice-13-0-1512925915676737536","title":"力竭2","text":"最后一课……","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1780751247064467339.wav","language":"中文","cv":"刘颐诺","category":"combat"},{"id":"1514097978770092032-voice-13-0-1512925915382890496","title":"力竭3","text":"什么都……想不起……","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1780751246992971662.wav","language":"中文","cv":"刘颐诺","category":"combat"},{"id":"1514097978770092032-voice-13-0-1512925918551240704","title":"声骸异能召唤","text":"记忆塑形！","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1780751247766718055.wav","language":"中文","cv":"刘颐诺","category":"combat"},{"id":"1514097978770092032-voice-13-0-1512925918194700288","title":"声骸异能变身","text":"记忆化形！","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1780751247668292693.wav","language":"中文","cv":"刘颐诺","category":"combat"},{"id":"1514097978770092032-voice-13-0-1512925915074138112","title":"进战提醒","text":"上课咯~","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1780751246939962113.wav","language":"中文","cv":"刘颐诺","category":"combat"},{"id":"1514097978770092032-voice-13-0-1512925914460143616","title":"滑翔","text":"嗯，这工具比以前好用多了~","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1780751246783826796.wav","language":"中文","cv":"刘颐诺","category":"combat"},{"id":"1514097978770092032-voice-13-0-1512925912490471424","title":"感知","text":"来看看是什么？","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1780751246222711702.wav","language":